  m_text: '




    I couldn''t reject the offer. They''re the ones who approached
    me in the first place. I really needed the money. The bureau? A secretive government
    association designed to contain the Paranormal Objects. I have nobody else to
    turn to, so I have no other choice but to face these monstrosities.'
